     <P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.2pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋">根据《</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-no-proof: yes">绍兴市教育局关于印发<SPAN lang=EN-US><</SPAN>绍兴市普通高中重点特色学科评估实施方案（试行）<SPAN lang=EN-US>></SPAN>和<SPAN lang=EN-US><</SPAN>绍兴市普通高中重点特色学科评估标准（试行）<SPAN lang=EN-US>></SPAN>的通知</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋">》（绍市教普〔<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>〕<SPAN lang=EN-US>83</SPAN>号）精神，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">为深化人才培养模式改革，为具有学科特长的优秀学生提供更充裕的个性化发展空间，我校<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年面向全市招收具有物理、信息学学科特长的应届初中毕业生，现将招生方案公布如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">一、招生对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">在绍兴市内就读的<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>届初三毕业生，具有绍兴市初中电子注册学籍。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">二、招生计划<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">物理学科不超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>名、信息学不超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>名。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">三、报名条件</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">报名者须</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">品学兼优、身体健康</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">、学习能力强、学科素养优秀，有强烈的进取心和责任感</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">，有物理或信息学特长</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">，符合下列条件之一优先考虑：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>学科特长明显。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">初中阶段获得过数学、科学、信息竞赛省级三等奖及以上或县（市、区）级一等奖及以上的学生（需提供相关获奖材料）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>2. </SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>学业成绩优秀。在初二两次期末考和初三第一学期期中、期末考中，学业成绩名列</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">学校</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>前茅的学生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><FONT face=宋体><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'>3.</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">报名参加信息学特长生的需有一定的信息学基础。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">四、报名方式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">符合报名条件的考生（家长），登陆绍兴市第一中学网站（<U><SPAN lang=EN-US>www.sxyz.net</SPAN></U>），下载《绍兴市普通高中特色学科招生报名表》并填写完整，在<?xml:namespace prefix = "st1" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="2" Month="5" Year="2018"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>日下午</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>5:00</SPAN>前直接向我校教学处（绍兴市站前大道<SPAN lang=EN-US>1898</SPAN>号，绍兴市第一中学</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">树兰楼<SPAN lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN>室</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">电话：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">0575-85338006</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">、<SPAN lang=EN-US>0575-85338226</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">）报名，提交以下材料。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">《绍兴市普通高中特色学科招生报名表》<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>份（附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">相关成绩证明材料复印件；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">相关获奖证书或获奖文件复印件；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">4.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">身份证或户口簿复印件；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">5.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">近期<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>寸免冠照片<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>张；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">6.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">初中学校出具的“学生基本信息表”；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 27pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">每个学生只允许选择报考一门特色学科。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">报名材料不退还，请留好备份。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Arial">五、选拔模式与程序<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
